terest` ceiling.\00\00\00\14OpenInterestExceeded\00\00\02\cb\00\00\00<An increase's notional buys no base size at the entry price.\00\00\00\10SizeRoundsToZero\00\00\02\cc\00\00\00)No position exists for `(user, is_long)`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\10PositionNotFound\00\00\02\d0\00\00\003The close exceeds the position's unlocked notional.\00\00\00\00\0eNotionalLocked\00\00\00\00\02\d1\00\00\00tLiquidation was attempted while equity is at or above the maintenance\0amargin and the delist deadline has not passed.\00\00\00\0fNotLiquidatable\00\00\00\02\d2\00\00\00\81Settled equity is below the maintenance margin, before a decrease or\0aADL, or after an open, increase, withdraw, or partial close.\00\00\00\00\00\00\14PositionLiquidatable\00\00\02\d3\00\00\00(No keeper order exists for `(user, id)`.\00\00\00\0dOrderNotFound\00\00\00\00\00\02\da\00\00\00?The order's `expiration` is behind the current ledger sequence.\00\00\00\00\0cOrderExpired\00\00\02\db\00\00\00\a7The order is malformed: an illegal delta pair, a value under its dust\0aor deposit floor, a zero `trigger_price` on a trigger kind, an escrow\0aoverflow, or a zero amount.\00\00\00\00\0cInvalidOrder\00\00\02\dc\00\00\00CA side already holds `MAX_ORDERS_PER_SIDE` pending decrease orders.\00\00\00\00\0dTooManyOrders\00\00\00\00\00\02\dd\00\00\00CAn order or vault-order `kind` discriminant is not a known variant.\00\00\00\00\0bUnknownKind\00\00\00\02\de\00\00\00\a0The verified price predates the order's creation, or the price the\0aposition was last marked against. Also a vault fill that runs in its\0aorder's creation ledger.\00\00\00\0aStalePrice\00\00\00\00\02\e4\00\00\007The fill price is worse than the order's `price_bound`.\00\00\00\00\12PriceBoundExceeded\00\00\00\00\02\e5\00\00\00GThe order's `trigger_price` has not been crossed at the verified\0aprice.\00\00\00\00\0dTriggerNotMet\00\00\00\00\00\02\e6\00\00\00'No vault order exists for `(user, id)`.\00\00\00\00\12VaultOrderNotFound\00\00\00\00\02\ee\00\00\00<A redeem